  ["flourish","decline","gullab-yashnamoq","The small town began to flourish after the new road opened."],
  ["tense","relaxed","taranglashgan","The players looked tense before the final match."],
  ["rare","common","kam uchraydigan","This rare bird is seen only in the mountains."],
  ["deny","admit","rad etmoq","He continued to deny the accusation, even after the evidence."],
  ["maximum","minimum","maksimal","The maximum speed on this road is 60 kilometres an hour."],
  ["triumph","tragedy","muvaffaqiyat","The film tells the story of a triumph after a long struggle."],
