  ["cheerful","gloomy","xushchaqchaq","The cheerful children played in the yard all afternoon."]
],
"C1":[
  ["mitigate","aggravate","yumshatmoq","Doctors tried to mitigate the pain without medicine that causes sleep."],
  ["coherent","incoherent","izchil","Her speech was coherent, so everyone followed the main idea."],
  ["tangible","intangible","ushlab ko'rib bo'ladigan","Tangible rewards, like money, motivate some people more than praise."],
  ["feasible","impractical","amalga oshadigan","The plan seems feasible, but the budget is not realistic."],
  ["prudent","rash","ehtiyotkor","It was prudent to save money before buying the car."],
  ["meticulous","careless","sinchkov","The meticulous editor found every mistake in the text."],
  ["candid","evasive","ochiq-oydin","He gave a candid answer, without trying to avoid the question."],
  ["ubiquitous","unusual","hamma yerda uchraydigan","Mobile phones are ubiquitous in the modern world."],
  ["lucid","opaque","tushunarli","Her lucid explanation helped everyone understand the theory."],
  ["eradicate","proliferate","yo'q qilmoq","The campaign aims to eradicate the disease before it spreads further."],
  ["volatile","stable","beqaror","Volatile markets make it hard to plan a long-term budget."],
  ["indispensable","dispensable","ajralmas","A good dictionary is indispensable for a language learner."],
  ["resilient","fragile","chidamli","Resilient communities recover quickly after a disaster."],
  ["ambivalent","decisive","ikkilanuvchi","She was ambivalent about the offer and could not decide."],
  ["explicit","implicit","aniq ifodalangan","The rules were explicit, so there was no room for doubt."],
  ["proponent","opponent","tarafdor","He is a proponent of free education, while his brother is an opponent."],
  ["legitimate","illegitimate","qonuniy","The court confirmed that the claim was legitimate."],
  ["empirical","theoretical","tajribaga asoslangan","The study offers empirical evidence, not just theoretical ideas."],
  ["discrepancy","consistency","nomuvofiqlik","There is a discrepancy between the two reports about the budget."],
  ["fluctuate","stabilize","o'zgarib turmoq","Temperatures fluctuate a lot during spring in this region."],
  ["scrutiny","neglect","sinchkov nazorat","The decision was under public scrutiny for weeks."],
  ["benevolent","malevolent","xayrixoh","The benevolent old man helped every child in the village."],
  ["diminish","augment","kamaytirmoq","Regular exercise can diminish the risk of heart disease."],
  ["superficial","profound","yuzaki","His superficial knowledge of history was clear during the debate."],
  ["tenacious","fickle","qat'iyatli","Her tenacious effort finally brought the results she wanted."],
  ["mundane","extraordinary","odatiy","Despite its mundane appearance, the building has an extraordinary history."],
  ["sporadic","constant","vaqti-vaqti bilan","The sporadic rain made the farmers worry about the crop."],
  ["spontaneous","planned","tasodifiy","Their spontaneous trip to the mountains was the best part of the year."],
  ["frugal","extravagant","tejamkor","My grandmother is frugal and never wastes food."],
  ["plausible","implausible","ishonarli","The explanation was plausible, although it was not proven."]
],
"A1":[
  ["hot","cold","issiq","The soup is very hot, please wait a minute."],
  ["big","small","katta","My house is big, but your house is small."],
  ["old","new","eski","This is an old car, and that one is new."],
  ["open","close","ochiq","Please open the window, it is hot in here."],
  ["up","down","yuqoriga","The bird flew up, then came down again."],
  ["yes","no","ha","Do you like tea? Yes, I do. No, I don't."],
  ["day","night","kun","The day is bright, but the night is dark."],
  ["happy","sad","xursand","She is happy today, but yesterday she was sad."],
  ["good","bad","yaxshi","The weather is good today, not bad at all."],
  ["young","old","yosh","My brother is young, but my grandfather is very old."],
  ["tall","short","baland bo'yli","My father is tall, and my mother is short."],
  ["fast","slow","tez","This train is fast, but the bus is slow."],
  ["easy","difficult","oson","This exercise is easy, but the last one is difficult."],
  ["rich","poor","boy","He is rich now, but he was poor as a child."],
  ["black","white","qora","My cat is black, and my dog is white."],
  ["clean","dirty","toza","Your shirt is clean, but my shoes are dirty."],
  ["full","empty","to'la","The glass is full of water, not empty."],
  ["inside","outside","ichida","It is warm inside, but very cold outside."],
  ["hard","soft","qattiq","This bread is hard, but that cake is soft."],
  ["winter","summer","qish","Winter is cold, and summer is hot."],
  ["start","stop","boshlamoq","The lesson will start at nine. Please don't stop now."],
  ["come","go","kelmoq","Please come here. Now you can go home."],
  ["sweet","sour","shirin","Honey is sweet, but a lemon is sour."],
  ["wet","dry","ho'l","The towel is wet, so hang it up to get dry."],
  ["buy","sell","sotib olmoq","I want to buy a new bag. Do you sell bags here?"],
  ["push","pull","itarmoq","Push the door to open it, and pull it to close."],
  ["heavy","light","og'ir","This box is heavy, but that bag is light."],
  ["strong","weak","kuchli","He is strong enough to lift the box. I am weak today."],
  ["beautiful","ugly","chiroyli","The garden is beautiful in spring, not ugly at all."],
  ["quiet","loud","jim","The library is quiet, but the street is loud."]
],
"A2":[
  ["early","late","erta","The bus is early today, but the train is late."],
  ["alive","dead","tirik","The old tree is still alive, but the other one is dead."],
  ["first","last","birinchi","She was the first to arrive, and he was the last."],
  ["north","south","shimol","The lake is in the north, and the desert is in the south."],
  ["left","right","chap","Turn left at the school, not right."],
  ["remember","forget","eslamoq","Please remember my name, and don't forget the keys."],
  ["win","lose","yutmoq","Our team will win the game if we don't lose our focus."],
  ["borrow","lend","qarzga olmoq","Can I borrow your pen? Can you lend me your pen?"],
  ["arrive","leave","kelmoq","We will arrive at noon and leave at six."],
  ["agree","disagree","rozi bo'lmoq","I agree with your plan, but my brother disagrees."],
  ["above","below","yuqorida","The picture is above the bed, and the shelf is below it."],
  ["before","after","oldin","Wash your hands before lunch and after playing."],
  ["stop","continue","to'xtamoq","The bus will stop here, but the train will continue."],
  ["give","take","bermoq","Give me your bag, and I will take your coat."],
  ["laugh","cry","kulmoq","The children laugh at the clown and never cry."],
  ["winner","loser","g'olib","The winner smiled, and the loser looked sad."],
  ["friend","enemy","do'st","He is my friend, not my enemy."],
  ["guilty","innocent","aybdor","The judge said he was innocent, not guilty."],
  ["brave","cowardly","jasur","The brave firefighter saved the child, not the cowardly man."],
  ["correct","wrong","to'g'ri","Your answer is correct, but my answer was wrong."],
  ["possible","impossible","mumkin","It is possible to finish today, but impossible to finish tomorrow."],
  ["public","private","ommaviy","This park is public, but that garden is private."],
  ["famous","unknown","mashhur","She is famous now, but she was unknown five years ago."],
  ["pass","fail","o'tmoq","If you study well, you will pass the exam, not fail it."],
  ["spend","save","sarflamoq","Don't spend all your money, try to save some."],
  ["rise","fall","ko'tarilmoq","Prices rise in summer, and they fall in winter."],
  ["sick","healthy","kasal","He was sick last week, but now he is healthy."],
  ["busy","free","band","I am busy now, but I will be free after lunch."],
  ["rough","smooth","qo'pol","The road is rough, but the new road is smooth."],
  ["clever","stupid","aqlli","My sister is clever, not stupid."]
],
"B1":[
  ["polite","rude","odobli","Be polite to your teacher, and never be rude."],
  ["thick","thin","qalin","The book is thick, but this magazine is thin."],
  ["wide","narrow","keng","The road is wide, but the bridge is narrow."],
  ["bright","dark","yorqin","The room is bright in the morning but dark at night."],
  ["increase","decrease","oshirmoq","The price will increase next year, not decrease."],
  ["safe","dangerous","xavfsiz","This area is safe, but that forest is dangerous."],
  ["wise","foolish","donishmand","An old man gave wise advice, not foolish ideas."],
  ["honest","dishonest","halol","An honest person tells the truth, not a dishonest story."],
  ["modern","traditional","zamonaviy","The modern city has tall buildings, but the old village is traditional."],
  ["success","failure","muvaffaqiyat","Hard work leads to success, not to failure."],
  ["offer","refuse","taklif qilmoq","He will offer help, and she may refuse it."],
  ["employer","employee","ish beruvchi","The employer pays the employee every month."],
  ["sharp","blunt","o'tkir","Use a sharp knife, not a blunt one."],
  ["deep","shallow","chuqur","The lake is deep, but the pool is shallow."],
  ["simple","complicated","oddiy","This question is simple, but the next one is complicated."],
  ["raise","lower","ko'tarmoq","Please raise your hand, and lower your voice."],
  ["hire","fire","yollamoq","The company will hire new staff and not fire anyone."],
  ["friendly","hostile","do'stona","The neighbours are friendly, not hostile at all."],
  ["tight","loose","tor","These shoes are tight, but my old ones were loose."],
  ["certain","uncertain","aniq","I am certain about the date, but the result is uncertain."],
  ["lucky","unlucky","omadli","She was lucky to find a job, while he was unlucky."],
  ["forward","backward","oldinga","Walk forward, not backward, when the bell rings."],
  ["valuable","worthless","qimmatli","This old ring is valuable, but the broken toy is worthless."],
  ["similar","different","o'xshash","Our answers are similar, but our methods are different."],
  ["fresh","stale","yangi","The bread is fresh, but yesterday's bread is stale."],
  ["crowded","deserted","gavjum","The market is crowded at noon but deserted at night."],
  ["shy","outgoing","uyatchan","He is shy in class, but his sister is outgoing."],
  ["guest","host","mehmon","The guest thanked the host for the dinner."],
  ["beginning","end","boshlanish","The beginning of the film was funny, but the end was sad."],
  ["noisy","quiet","shovqinli","The street is noisy, but my room is quiet."]
]
};
let joriyAntonimDaraja='B2';

/* ── SO'ZLIK ── */
function sozlikKo_rsatish(){
  const royxat = SOZLAR_DB[joriySozlikDaraja];
  document.getElementById('kontent-joy').innerHTML=`
    <div class="sahifa-sarlavha">
      <h2>So'zlik — ${JAMI_SOZLAR} So'z</h2>
      <p>Dunyo bo'yicha eng ko'p ishlatiladigan inglizcha so'zlar, A1 dan C1 gacha (C2 kamdan-kam kerak bo'lgani uchun kiritilmagan)</p>
    </div>
    <div class="daraja-filter">
      ${Object.keys(DARAJA_NOMLARI).map(d=>`<button class="daraja-tugma ${joriySozlikDaraja===d?'tanlangan':''}" onclick="sozlikDaraja('${d}')">${DARAJA_NOMLARI[d]}</button>`).join('')}
    </div>
    <div class="sozlik-son">${royxat.length} ta so'z — ${DARAJA_NOMLARI[joriySozlikDaraja]}</div>
    <div class="sozlik-grid">
      ${royxat.slice(0,sozlikKorsatilgan).map(([en,uz])=>`
        <div class="sozlik-karta">
                    <div class="inglizcha">${en}</div>
          <div class="uzbekcha">🇺🇿 ${uz}</div>
          <button class="sozlik-eshit" onclick="gapirtir('${en.replace(/'/g,"\\'")}')" title="Tinglash">🔊</button>
        </div>`).join('')}
    </div>
    ${royxat.length>sozlikKorsatilgan?`<div style="text-align:center;margin:18px 0 6px;"><button class="daraja-tugma" style="min-height:46px;padding:10px 24px;font-size:14px;" onclick="sozlikYana()">Yana ko'rsatish (${Math.min(SOZLIK_QADAM,royxat.length-sozlikKorsatilgan)} ta) ▼</button><div class="sozlik-son" style="margin-top:8px;">${sozlikKorsatilgan} / ${royxat.length}</div></div>`:''}`;
  document.getElementById('sozSoni').textContent=`${JAMI_SOZLAR} so'z, 5 daraja`;
}
function sozlikDaraja(d){joriySozlikDaraja=d;sozlikKorsatilgan=SOZLIK_QADAM;sozlikKo_rsatish();}
function sozlikYana(){sozlikKorsatilgan+=SOZLIK_QADAM;sozlikKo_rsatish();}

/* ── SINONIMLAR SAHIFASI ── */
function sinonimKo_rsatish(){
  const royxat=SINONIMLAR[joriySinonimDaraja]||[];
  const q=x=>x.replace(/'/g,"\\'");
  document.getElementById('kontent-joy').innerHTML=`
    <div class="sahifa-sarlavha">
      <h2>Sinonimlar — ${royxat.length} juftlik</h2>
      <p>Bir xil ma'noli, lekin boshqacha yoziladigan so'zlar. Har juftlikni tinglab ko'ring.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#071220;border:1px solid var(--chegara);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
      <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;">💡 Sinonim nima?</div>
      <div>Sinonim — <b>ma'nosi bir xil yoki juda yaqin</b>, lekin yozilishi boshqa so'z.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--osmon);">Misol: <b>big</b> va <b>large</b> — ikkalasi ham "katta" degani.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:4px;">✅ "The house is <b>big</b>." → "The house is <b>large</b>." — ma'no o'zgarmaydi.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--kulrang);">Eslatma: sinonimlar 100% bir xil emas. Masalan, "big" ko'proq kundalik nutqda ishlatiladi.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="daraja-filter">
      ${Object.keys(SINONIMLAR).map(d=>`<button class="daraja-tugma ${joriySinonimDaraja===d?'tanlangan':''}" onclick="sinonimDaraja('${d}')">${DARAJA_NOMLARI[d]||d}</button>`).join('')}
    </div>
    <div class="sozlik-grid">
      ${royxat.map(([w,s,uz])=>`
        <div class="sozlik-karta">
                    <div class="inglizcha">${w} <span style="color:var(--kulrang);font-weight:400;">≈</span> ${s}</div>
          <div class="uzbekcha">🇺🇿 ${uz}</div>
          <button class="sozlik-eshit" onclick="gapirtir('${q(w)}')" title="Tinglash">🔊</button>
        </div>`).join('')}
    </div>`;
}
function sinonimDaraja(d){joriySinonimDaraja=d;sinonimKo_rsatish();}

/* ── OMONIMLAR SAHIFASI ── */
function omonimKo_rsatish(){
  const royxat=OMONIMLAR[joriyOmonimDaraja]||[];
  const q=x=>x.replace(/'/g,"\\'");
  document.getElementById('kontent-joy').innerHTML=`
    <div class="sahifa-sarlavha">
      <h2>Omonimlar — ${royxat.length} so'z</h2>
      <p>Bir xil yoziladigan, lekin turli ma'noga ega so'zlar. Gap ma'noni belgilaydi.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#071220;border:1px solid var(--chegara);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
      <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;">💡 Omonim nima?</div>
      <div>Omonim — <b>yozilishi bir xil</b>, lekin <b>turli ma'noli</b> so'z. Ma'noni <b>gap</b> belgilaydi.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--osmon);">Misol: <b>bank</b></div>
      <div style="margin-top:4px;">🏦 "I went to the <b>bank</b> to get money." → moliya muassasasi</div>
      <div style="margin-top:4px;">🏞 "We sat on the <b>bank</b> of the river." → daryo qirg'og'i</div>
      <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--kulrang);">Eslatma: ba'zan talaffuz ham farq qiladi (masalan, "lead" — yetakchilik qilmoq / qo'rg'oshin).</div>
    </div>
    <div class="daraja-filter">
      ${Object.keys(OMONIMLAR).map(d=>`<button class="daraja-tugma ${joriyOmonimDaraja===d?'tanlangan':''}" onclick="omonimDaraja('${d}')">${DARAJA_NOMLARI[d]||d}</button>`).join('')}
    </div>
    <div class="sozlik-grid">
      ${royxat.map(([w,senses])=>`
        <div class="sozlik-karta" style="grid-column:1 / -1;">
                    <div class="inglizcha">${w}</div>
          ${senses.map(([uz,gap],i)=>`
            <div class="uzbekcha" style="margin-top:6px;">${i+1}. 🇺🇿 ${uz}</div>
            <div style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--osmon);">${gap.replace(new RegExp('\\b'+w+'\\b','i'),m=>`<strong style="color:var(--sariq);">${m}</strong>`)}</div>
            <button class="sozlik-eshit" style="position:static;display:inline-flex;margin:2px 0 8px;" onclick="gapirtir('${q(gap)}')" title="Tinglash">🔊</button>`).join('')}
        </div>`).join('')}
    </div>`;
}
function omonimDaraja(d){joriyOmonimDaraja=d;omonimKo_rsatish();}

/* ── ANTONIMLAR SAHIFASI ── */
function antonimKo_rsatish(){
  const royxat=ANTONIMLAR[joriyAntonimDaraja]||[];
  const q=x=>x.replace(/'/g,"\\'");
  const hl=(s,w)=>s.replace(new RegExp('\\b'+w+'\\b','i'),m=>`<strong style="color:var(--sariq);">${m}</strong>`);
  document.getElementById('kontent-joy').innerHTML=`
    <div class="sahifa-sarlavha">
      <h2>Antonimlar — ${royxat.length} juftlik</h2>
      <p>Ma'nosi qarama-qarshi so'zlar. Har juftlik misol gap bilan berilgan.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background:#071220;border:1px solid var(--chegara);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
      <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;">💡 Antonim nima?</div>
      <div>Antonim — <b>ma'nosi teskari</b> so'z. Masalan, <b>hot</b> (issiq) ↔ <b>cold</b> (sovuq).</div>
      <div style="margin-top:8px;">✅ "The soup is <b>hot</b>." → "The soup is <b>cold</b>." — gap butunlay boshqacha ma'noga ega.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--kulrang);">Eslatma: antonimlarni gapda ishlatishda ma'no to'g'ri kelishiga e'tibor bering.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="daraja-filter">
      ${Object.keys(ANTONIMLAR).map(d=>`<button class="daraja-tugma ${joriyAntonimDaraja===d?'tanlangan':''}" onclick="antonimDaraja('${d}')">${DARAJA_NOMLARI[d]||d}</button>`).join('')}
    </div>
    <div class="sozlik-grid">
      ${royxat.map(([w,a,uz,ex])=>`
        <div class="sozlik-karta" style="grid-column:1 / -1;">
                    <div class="inglizcha">${w} <span style="color:var(--kulrang);font-weight:400;">↔</span> ${a}</div>
          <div class="uzbekcha">🇺🇿 ${uz}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--osmon);margin-top:4px;">${hl(ex,w)}</div>
          <button class="sozlik-eshit" style="position:static;display:inline-flex;margin:2px 0 4px;" onclick="gapirtir('${q(ex)}')" title="Tinglash">🔊</button>
        </div>`).join('')}
    </div>`;
}
function antonimDaraja(d){joriyAntonimDaraja=d;antonimKo_rsatish();}

/* ── ANTONIM SAVOLLARI (test rejimi) ── */
function antSavolOne(d,[w,a,uz,ex]){
  const hamma=Object.keys(ANTONIMLAR).flatMap(k=>ANTONIMLAR[k].map(x=>[k,...x]));
  const chal=[];
  const yaqin={frugal:['stingy','generous']};
  aralashtir(hamma).forEach(([xd,xw,xa,xuz])=>{
    if(chal.length>=3) return;
    if(xw===w||xa===a||xw===a||xa===w||chal.includes(xa)) return;
    if((yaqin[w]||[]).includes(xa)) return;
    if(uzOxshash(xuz,uz)) return;
    chal.push(xa);
  });
  const variantlar=aralashtir([a,...chal]);
  const hl=ex.replace(new RegExp('\\b'+w+'\\b','i'),m=>`<span style="color:var(--sariq);font-weight:800;">${m}</span>`);
  return {savol:`'${w}' (${uz}) so'zining antonimi qaysi?<br><span style="color:var(--osmon);font-weight:500;">${hl}</span>`,variantlar,togri:variantlar.indexOf(a),izoh:`🇬🇧 ${w} ↔ ${a} — ${uz}<br>${ex}`,teg:{tur:'antonim',daraja:d,en:w}};
}
function antonimSavollari(daraja,son){
  const hamma=Object.keys(ANTONIMLAR).flatMap(d=>ANTONIMLAR[d].map(x=>[d,...x]));
  const pool=ANTONIMLAR[daraja]&&ANTONIMLAR[daraja].length?hamma.filter(x=>x[0]===daraja):hamma;
  return aralashtir(pool).slice(0,son).map(([d,...e])=>antSavolOne(d,e));
}
/* ── OMONIM SAVOLLARI (test rejimi) ── */
function omSavolOne(d,[w,senses]){
  const hamma=Object.values(OMONIMLAR).flat();
  const sensalar=hamma.flatMap(([x,ss])=>ss.map(([uz])=>({w:x,uz})));
  const k=Math.random()<0.5?0:1;
  const [togriUz,gap]=senses[k];
  const boshqaUz=senses[1-k][0];
  const chal=[boshqaUz];
  aralashtir(sensalar).forEach(x=>{
    if(chal.length>=3) return;
    if(x.w===w||chal.includes(x.uz)) return;
    if(uzOxshash(x.uz,togriUz)||uzOxshash(x.uz,boshqaUz)) return;
    chal.push(x.uz);
  });
  const variantlar=aralashtir([togriUz,...chal]);
  const highlight=gap.replace(new RegExp('\\b'+w+'\\b','i'),m=>`<span style="color:var(--sariq);font-weight:800;">${m}</span>`);
  return {savol:`Gapdagi "${w}" qaysi ma'noda ishlatilgan?<br><span style="color:var(--osmon);font-weight:500;">${highlight}</span>`,variantlar,togri:variantlar.indexOf(togriUz),izoh:`🇬🇧 ${gap}<br>🇺🇿 ${w} — ${togriUz}`,teg:{tur:'omonim',daraja:d,en:w}};
}
function omonimSavollari(daraja,son){
  const hamma=Object.keys(OMONIMLAR).flatMap(d=>OMONIMLAR[d].map(x=>[d,x]));
  const pool=OMONIMLAR[daraja]&&OMONIMLAR[daraja].length?hamma.filter(x=>x[0]===daraja):hamma;
  return aralashtir(pool).slice(0,son).map(([d,e])=>omSavolOne(d,e));
}
/* ── SINONIM SAVOLLARI (test rejimi) ── */
function sinSavolOne(daraja,[w,s,uz]){
  const pool=SINONIMLAR[daraja]||[];
  const chal=[];
  aralashtir(pool).forEach(([xw,xs,xuz])=>{
    if(chal.length>=3) return;
    if(xw===w||xw===s||xs===w||xs===s||chal.includes(xs)) return;
    if(uzOxshash(xuz,uz)) return;
    chal.push(xs);
  });
  const variantlar=aralashtir([s,...chal]);
  return {savol:`'${w}' (${uz}) so'zining sinonimi qaysi?`,variantlar,togri:variantlar.indexOf(s),izoh:`🇬🇧 ${w} ≈ ${s} — ${uz}`,teg:{tur:'sinonim',daraja,en:w}};
}
function sinonimSavollari(daraja,son){
  return aralashtir(SINONIMLAR[daraja]||[]).slice(0,son).map(e=>sinSavolOne(daraja,e));
}
/* ── GRAMMATIKA ── */
function grammatikaKo_rsatish(){
  document.getElementById('kontent-joy').innerHTML=`
    <div class="sahifa-sarlavha">
      <h2>Grammatika — Eng Muhim 40 Mavzu</h2>
      <p>A1–C1: har mavzuda qoida, misollar va mashqlar. Tuzilishi "Grammar in Use" kitobidan ilhomlangan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grammatika-royxat">
      ${GRAMMATIKA_20.map((g,i)=>`
        <div class="grammatika-element">
          <div class="grammatika-bosh" onclick="${g.tayyor?`grammatikaToglash(${i})`:''}" style="${g.tayyor?'':'opacity:.5;cursor:default;'}">
            <span class="unit-raqam">${i+1}</span>
            <span class="belgi" style="flex-shrink:0;">${g.daraja}</span>
            <span style="flex:1;">${g.sarlavha}</span>
            <span>${g.tayyor?(grammatikaOchiq===i?'▲':'▼'):'🔜'}</span>
          </div>
          ${g.tayyor&&grammatikaOchiq===i?`<div class="grammatika-tana ochiq">
            <div class="qoida-blok"><strong>📖 Qoida:</strong><br>${g.qoida.replace(/\n/g,'<br>')}</div>
            <div class="qoida-blok" style="border-left-color:var(--sariq);"><strong>🧭 O'rgatish namunasi:</strong><br>${g.ogatish}</div>
            ${g.misollar.map(m=>`<div class="misol-qator"><div class="misol-ingliz">🇬🇧 ${m.ingliz}</div><div class="misol-uzbek">🇺🇿 ${m.uzbek}</div></div>`).join('')}
            ${g.xato?`<div class="xato-ogohlantirish">⚠️ Tipik xato: ${g.xato}</div>`:''}
            <div style="margin-top:18px;">
              <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--sariq);margin-bottom:10px;">✏️ Mashqlar — bilimingizni sinang</div>
              ${g.mashqlar.map((m,qi)=>`
                <div style="margin-bottom:14px;padding:14px;background:#071220;border-radius:10px;">
                  <div style="font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:10px;">${qi+1}. ${m.savol}</div>
                  <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;">
                    ${m.variantlar.map((v,oi)=>`<button class="test-variant" id="gm_${g.raqam}_${qi}_${oi}" onclick="grammatikaMashqJavob(${i},${qi},${oi})">${v}</button>`).join('')}
                  </div>
                  <div id="gm_natija_${g.raqam}_${qi}"></div>
                </div>`).join('')}
            </div>
          </div>`:''}
        </div>`).join('')}
    </div>
    <div class="manba-eslatma">📘 Ushbu bo'lim mashhur "Grammar in Use" (Raymond Murphy) kitoblarining unit tuzilishidan ilhomlangan — barcha qoida, misol va mashqlar original tayyorlangan.</div>`;
}
function grammatikaToglash(i){grammatikaOchiq=grammatikaOchiq===i?-1:i;grammatikaKo_rsatish();}
function grammatikaMashqJavob(unitIdx,qi,oi){
  const g=GRAMMATIKA_20[unitIdx];
  const kalit=g.raqam+'_'+qi;
  if(grammatikaMashqJavoblandi[kalit]) return;
  grammatikaMashqJavoblandi[kalit]=true;
  const m=g.mashqlar[qi];
  const togri=oi===m.togri;
  if(togri) xpQoshish(4);
  kunlikQayd(0,1,togri?1:0);
  if(togri){ if(!PROGRESS.gramYechilgan) PROGRESS.gramYechilgan={}; PROGRESS.gramYechilgan[kalit]=true; progressSaqlash(PROGRESS); }
  for(let k=0;k<m.variantlar.length;k++){
    const btn=document.getElementById('gm_'+g.raqam+'_'+qi+'_'+k);
    if(!btn) continue;
    btn.disabled=true;
    if(k===m.togri) btn.classList.add('togri');
    if(k===oi&&!togri) btn.classList.add('noto-gri');
  }
  const natijaEl=document.getElementById('gm_natija_'+g.raqam+'_'+qi);
  if(natijaEl) natijaEl.innerHTML=`<div class="test-fikr ${togri?'yaxshi':'yomon'}" style="margin-top:10px;">${togri?"✅ To'g'ri! +4 XP":"❌ Noto'g'ri."} ${m.izoh}</div>`;
}

/* ── TEST: TASODIFIY, DARAJA QULFI + XP + JONLAR (XATO LIMITI) ── */
const TEST_JONLAR_BOSHLANGICH=5;
let testJonlar=TEST_JONLAR_BOSHLANGICH;
let testDarajaOchildiKorsatildi=false;

const TEST_REJIMLAR=[['aralash','🎲 Aralash'],['soz',"🔤 So'z tarjimasi"],['sinonim','🔁 Sinonim'],['omonim','🔀 Omonim'],['antonim','↔️ Antonim'],['teskari','🔁 Teskari tarjima'],['tingla','🎧 Eshitib top'],['gapda',"📝 Gapda so'z"],['boshliq',"✏️ Bo'shliq"],['gram','📘 Grammatika'],['zamon','⏱ Qaysi zamon?'],['xato','♻️ Xatolar']];
let testRejim='aralash';
let testXatolar=[];

/* Savol qaysi grammatika mavzusiga tegishli ekanini bildiruvchi jadval (FILL_BANK tartibi bo'yicha) */
const FILL_MAVZU={
A1:[1,1,1,2,2,3,7,24,12,12],
A2:[14,11,16,18,13,15,21,null,17,21],
B1:[16,30,19,25,25,15,null,16,28,13],
B2:[34,35,null,39,25,25,null,31,39,null],
C1:[39,31,39,27,null,null,null,39]
};
const TENSE_MAVZU={'Present Simple':2,'Present Continuous':9,'Past Simple':11,'Past Continuous':14,'Present Perfect':16,'Future Simple':17,'Future (going to)':17,'Past Perfect':28,'Present Perfect Continuous':29};

/* ── ZAIF SO'Z VA MAVZULAR: xato qilinganlar ko'proq qaytadi ── */
function zaifTayyorla(){ if(!PROGRESS.zaif) PROGRESS.zaif={}; if(!PROGRESS.zaifGram) PROGRESS.zaifGram={}; }
function zaifBelgila(tur,kalit,togri){
  zaifTayyorla();
  const m=tur==='soz'?PROGRESS.zaif:PROGRESS.zaifGram;
  if(togri){ if(m[kalit]){ m[kalit]-=1; if(m[kalit]<=0) delete m[kalit]; } }
  else m[kalit]=Math.min((m[kalit]||0)+1,5);
  progressSaqlash(PROGRESS);
}
function uzTokenlar(s){return String(s).toLowerCase().replace(/\(.*?\)/g,' ').split(/[\s\/,;]+/).map(x=>x.trim()).filter(x=>x.length>2);}
function uzOxshash(a,b){const A=uzTokenlar(a),B=uzTokenlar(b);return A.some(x=>B.includes(x));}
function sozTanlash(daraja,son){
  const pool=SOZLAR_DB[daraja]||[];const hozir=Date.now();
  const zaif=[],due=[],qolgan=[];
  pool.forEach(w=>{
    const k=sozKaliti(daraja,w[0]);
    if(PROGRESS.zaif&&PROGRESS.zaif[k]) zaif.push(w);
    else{const h=PROGRESS.sozlar[k]; if(h&&h.keyingi<=hozir&&h.level<5) due.push(w); else qolgan.push(w);}
  });
  const ustuvor=[...aralashtir(zaif),...aralashtir(due)].slice(0,Math.ceil(son/2));
  const ishlatilgan=new Set(ustuvor.map(w=>w[0]));
  const yangi=aralashtir(qolgan).filter(w=>!ishlatilgan.has(w[0])).slice(0,Math.max(0,son-ustuvor.length));
  return aralashtir([...ustuvor,...yangi]).slice(0,son);
}
function ochiqSozlar(son){
  const ochiq=DARAJA_TARTIBI.filter(darajaOchiqmi);
  const har=Math.ceil(son/ochiq.length)+2;
  let r=[];ochiq.forEach(d=>sozTanlash(d,har).forEach(w=>r.push([w[0],w[1],d])));
  return aralashtir(r).slice(0,son);
}
function chalgitgichlar(pool,w,kalit){
  const korilgan=new Set([w[kalit]]);
  return aralashtir(pool.filter(x=>x[0]!==w[0]&&!uzOxshash(x[1],w[1]))).filter(x=>!korilgan.has(x[kalit])&&korilgan.add(x[kalit])).slice(0,3).map(x=>x[kalit]);
}

/* ── SAVOL YASOVCHILAR ── */
function sozSavollari(daraja,son){
  const pool=SOZLAR_DB[daraja];
  return sozTanlash(daraja,son).map(w=>{
    const [en,uz]=w;
    const variantlar=aralashtir([uz,...chalgitgichlar(pool,w,1)]);
    return {savol:`'${en}' so'zining o'zbekcha ma'nosi qaysi?`,variantlar,togri:variantlar.indexOf(uz),izoh:'',teg:{tur:'soz',daraja,en}};
  });
}
/* Takrorlash: joriy daraja testiga oldingi ochiq darajalardagi so'zlarni aralashtiradi (yod bo'lib qolmasligi uchun) */
function sharhSavollari(daraja,son){
  if(son<=0) return [];
  const oldingi=DARAJA_TARTIBI.slice(0,DARAJA_TARTIBI.indexOf(daraja)).filter(darajaOchiqmi);
  if(!oldingi.length) return [];
  const zaifSoz=[], qolgan=[];
  oldingi.forEach(d=>SOZLAR_DB[d].forEach(w=>{
    const h=PROGRESS.sozlar[sozKaliti(d,w[0])];
    (h&&h.level<5?zaifSoz:qolgan).push([d,w]);
  }));
  const tanlov=[...aralashtir(zaifSoz),...aralashtir(qolgan)].slice(0,son);
  return tanlov.map(([d,w])=>{
    const [en,uz]=w, pool=SOZLAR_DB[d], teg={tur:'soz',daraja:d,en,takror:true};
    if(Math.random()<0.5){
      const v=aralashtir([uz,...chalgitgichlar(pool,w,1)]);
      return {savol:`'${en}' so'zining o'zbekcha ma'nosi qaysi?`,variantlar:v,togri:v.indexOf(uz),izoh:'',teg};
    }
    const v=aralashtir([en,...chalgitgichlar(pool,w,0)]);
    return {savol:`"${uz}" — inglizchasi qaysi?`,variantlar:v,togri:v.indexOf(en),izoh:'',teg};
  });
}
function teskariSavollari(daraja,son){
  const pool=SOZLAR_DB[daraja];
  return sozTanlash(daraja,son).map(w=>{
    const [en,uz]=w;
    const variantlar=aralashtir([en,...chalgitgichlar(pool,w,0)]);
    return {savol:`"${uz}" — inglizchasi qaysi?`,variantlar,togri:variantlar.indexOf(en),izoh:'',teg:{tur:'soz',daraja,en}};
  });
}
function tinglaSavollari(daraja,son){
  const pool=SOZLAR_DB[daraja];
  const ovozBor=typeof window!=='undefined'&&'speechSynthesis' in window;
  return sozTanlash(daraja,son).map(w=>{
    const [en,uz]=w;
    const variantlar=aralashtir([uz,...chalgitgichlar(pool,w,1)]);
    const ovoz=`<div style="text-align:center;margin:6px 0 4px;"><button class="katta-ovoz" onclick="oyinOvoz(decodeURIComponent('${encodeURIComponent(en)}'))">🔊</button></div>`;
    return {savol:`Eshiting va ma'nosini toping:${ovoz}${ovozBor?'':`<div style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">${en}</div>`}`,variantlar,togri:variantlar.indexOf(uz),izoh:`🇬🇧 ${en} — ${uz}`,avto:en,teg:{tur:'soz',daraja,en}};
  });
}
/* ── GAPDA SO'Z: har daraja so'zlari gap ichida (130 ta) ── */
const CLOZE_BANK={"A1":[["I drink a cup of ___ every morning.","tea",["chair","door","bed"],"tea","Men har ertalab bir piyola choy ichaman."],["Please sit on the ___.","chair",["soup","week","pen"],"chair","Iltimos, stulga o'tiring."],["My mother cooks ___ for dinner. It is hot and tasty.","soup",["door","pen","window"],"soup","Onam kechki ovqatga sho'rva pishiradi. U issiq va mazali."],["Write your name with a ___.","pen",["soup","bed","kitchen"],"pen","Ismingizni ruchka bilan yozing."],["I go to ___ at eight o'clock every morning. I am a student.","school",["kitchen","soup","window"],"school","Men har kuni ertalab soat sakkizda maktabga boraman. Men o'quvchiman."],["It is cold. Please close the ___.","window",["bread","tea","Monday"],"window","Sovuq. Iltimos, derazani yoping."],["My ___ is a doctor. She works in a hospital.","mother",["pen","house","bread"],"mother","Onam shifokor. U kasalxonada ishlaydi."],["I have two brothers and one ___.","sister",["soup","key","hour"],"sister","Mening ikkita aka-ukam va bitta singlim bor."],["We eat ___ with meat and vegetables.","rice",["chair","wall","clock"],"rice","Biz go'sht va sabzavot bilan guruch yeymiz."],["What ___ is it? — It is five o'clock.","time",["bag","tea","teacher"],"time","Soat necha? — Soat besh."],["Today is Monday. ___ is Tuesday.","Tomorrow",["Yesterday","Evening","Week"],"tomorrow","Bugun dushanba. Ertaga seshanba."],["I like to ___ in the park and look at the trees.","walk",["wash","drink","say"],"walk","Men bog'da yurib, daraxtlarga qarashni yaxshi ko'raman."],["Can you ___ me? I can't hear you.","hear",["read","write","drink"],"hear","Meni eshityapsizmi? Men sizni eshita olmayapman."],["She is a good ___. She teaches English at our school.","teacher",["window","bus","bed"],"teacher","U yaxshi o'qituvchi. U ingliz tilidan dars beradi."],["I can't open the door. Where is my ___?","key",["bread","soup","class"],"key","Men eshikni ocha olmayapman. Kalitim qani?"],["He has a big ___ with a garden.","house",["soup","pen","hour"],"house","Uning bog'li katta uyi bor."],["A ___ is very small. It sleeps and drinks milk.","baby",["teacher","man","wall"],"baby","Chaqaloq juda kichkina. U uxlaydi va sut ichadi."],["It is very ___ today. I need a coat.","cold",["hot","new","big"],"cold","Bugun juda sovuq. Menga palto kerak."],["My grandfather is ___. He is eighty years old.","old",["new","small","short"],"old","Bobom keksa. U sakson yoshda."],["I ___ pizza. It is my favourite food.","love",["hear","walk","write"],"love","Men pitsani yaxshi ko'raman. Bu mening sevimli taomim."],["I am hungry. I want to ___ some bread.","eat",["sleep","run","write"],"eat","Men ochman. Men non yemoqchiman."],["She ___ a book every night before bed.","reads",["runs","drinks","swims"],"read","U har kecha uxlashdan oldin kitob o'qiydi."],["My brother is very tall, but my sister is ___.","short",["red","hot","new"],"short","Akam juda baland, lekin singlim pakana."],["It is eight o'clock. The ___ starts now.","lesson",["window","apple","dog"],"lesson","Soat sakkiz. Dars hozir boshlanadi."],["The ___ is very hot today, so I wear a hat.","sun",["floor","key","milk"],"sun","Bugun quyosh juda issiq, shuning uchun men shlyapa kiyaman."],["He has a ___ and two cats at home.","dog",["spoon","street","plate"],"dog","Uning uyida bitta it va ikkita mushuk bor."],["Can you ___ me with my homework?","help",["eat","wash","jump"],"help","Uy vazifamda menga yordam bera olasizmi?"],["I ___ my hands before dinner.","wash",["kick","fly","marry"],"wash","Men kechki ovqatdan oldin qo'limni yuvaman."],["The shop is ___ on Sundays, so we can't buy bread.","closed",["new","red","short"],"close","Do'kon yakshanba kunlari yopiq, shuning uchun non sotib ololmaymiz."],["I put sugar in my ___.","coffee",["shoe","wall","bus"],"coffee","Men qahvamga shakar solaman."],["The baby is ___. She wants her mother.","crying",["jumping","cooking","swimming"],"cry","Chaqaloq yig'layapti. U onasini xohlayapti."],["My father drives a ___ 