","festival"],"disaster","Zilziladan keyin ko'p odamlar uysiz qoldi. Bu dahshatli ofat edi."],["Scientists made an important ___ about a new planet.","discovery",["donation","wealth","fine"],"discovery","Olimlar yangi sayyora haqida muhim kashfiyot qilishdi."]],"B2":[["The study provides clear ___ that exercise improves memory.","evidence",["bias","threshold","benchmark"],"evidence","Tadqiqot mashq xotirani yaxshilashiga aniq dalil keltiradi."],["We need to ___ the results before we make a decision.","analyze",["launch","curb","navigate"],"analyze","Qaror qabul qilishdan oldin natijalarni tahlil qilishimiz kerak."],["The company has a new ___ to increase sales.","strategy",["threshold","constraint","hypothesis"],"strategy","Kompaniyada savdoni oshirish uchun yangi strategiya bor."],["Smoking has serious health ___.","consequences",["criteria","components","elements"],"consequence","Chekishning sog'liq uchun jiddiy oqibatlari bor."],["Please give a ___ explanation. Don't write too much.","brief",["vital","immense","rigid"],"brief","Iltimos, qisqa tushuntiring. Ko'p yozmang."],["Eating too much sugar can ___ your health.","undermine",["conclude","indicate","allege"],"undermine","Juda ko'p shakar iste'mol qilish sog'lig'ingizga zarar yetkazishi mumkin."],["The scientist's ___ is that sleep helps memory.","hypothesis",["momentum","benchmark","disparity"],"hypothesis","Olimning gipotezasi shuki, uyqu xotiraga yordam beradi."],["There is a big ___ between rich and poor families.","disparity",["momentum","synergy","causation"],"disparity","Boy va kambag'al oilalar o'rtasida katta tafovut bor."],["A good leader must ___ tasks to team members.","delegate",["exceed","encounter","disclose"],"delegate","Yaxshi rahbar vazifalarni jamoa a'zolariga topshirishi kerak."],["He was ___ to answer because he didn't want to cause trouble.","reluctant",["obvious","subtle","vital"],"reluctant","U muammo chiqarmaslik uchun javob berishni istamadi."],["The ___ of the project is to reduce waste.","objective",["threshold","trajectory","momentum"],"objective","Loyihaning maqsadi chiqindini kamaytirish."],["We should ___ the problem carefully before we act.","assess",["launch","merge","retain"],"assess","Harakat qilishdan oldin muammoni sinchiklab baholashimiz kerak."],["The company wants to ___ its products in new countries.","launch",["endure","exceed","diminish"],"launch","Kompaniya mahsulotlarini yangi mamlakatlarda ishga tushirmoqchi."],["It took years to ___ their goal.","accomplish",["disclose","deviate","dwindle"],"accomplish","Ularning maqsadiga erishish uchun yillar kerak bo'ldi."],["The rules are very ___. No one can change them.","rigid",["versatile","flexible","dynamic"],"rigid","Qoidalar juda qat'iy. Hech kim ularni o'zgartira olmaydi."],["This tool is very ___. You can use it for many jobs.","versatile",["rigid","harsh","desperate"],"versatile","Bu asbob juda ko'p qirrali. Uni ko'p ishlarda ishlatish mumkin."],["The heavy rain caused ___ damage to the crops.","considerable",["eager","rigid","reluctant"],"considerable","Kuchli yomg'ir ekinlarga sezilarli zarar yetkazdi."],["She wants to ___ a new language in six months.","acquire",["exceed","hinder","undermine"],"acquire","U olti oyda yangi til o'rganib olmoqchi."],["Accidents ___ when drivers are tired.","occur",["alter","ensure","enforce"],"occur","Haydovchilar charchaganida baxtsiz hodisalar sodir bo'ladi."],["The government plans to ___ new rules about plastic bags.","impose",["dwindle","hesitate","evolve"],"impose","Hukumat plastik paketlarga oid yangi qoidalarni joriy etmoqchi."],["He ___ at the door for a moment before he came in.","hesitated",["dominated","exploited","inherited"],"hesitate","U kirishdan oldin eshik oldida bir lahza ikkilandi."],["She finally ___ a visa after three months.","obtained",["ceased","collapsed","consumed"],"obtain","U uch oydan keyin nihoyat viza oldi."],["The bridge ___ after the earthquake.","collapsed",["guaranteed","harnessed","illustrated"],"collapse","Ko'prik zilziladan keyin quladi."],["This watch comes with a two-year ___.","guarantee",["conflict","obstacle","dilemma"],"guarantee","Bu soatga ikki yillik kafolat beriladi."],["Hard work and patience helped her to overcome every ___.","obstacle",["outcome","guarantee","formula"],"obstacle","Mehnat va sabr unga har bir to'siqni yengishga yordam berdi."],["The test has a small ___. One question has two correct answers.","flaw",["formula","outcome","guarantee"],"flaw","Testda kichik nuqson bor. Bitta savolning ikkita to'g'ri javobi bor."],["He faced a difficult ___: stay with his family or take the job abroad.","dilemma",["flaw","formula","guarantee"],"dilemma","U qiyin tanlov oldida qoldi: oilasi bilan qolishmi yoki chet eldagi ishni olishmi."],["She was ___ to start her new job.","eager",["identical","harsh","abstract"],"eager","U yangi ishini boshlashga intiq edi."],["The two photos look ___. I can't see any difference.","identical",["harsh","eager","gradual"],"identical","Ikki surat bir xil ko'rinadi. Men hech qanday farq ko'rmayapman."],["The increase in prices was ___ over ten years.","gradual",["identical","eager","abstract"],"gradual","Narxlarning oshishi o'n yil davomida asta-sekin bo'ldi."],["It is ___ that prices will rise when fuel costs increase.","inevitable",["authentic","ambiguous","sophisticated"],"inevitable","Yoqilg'i narxi oshsa, narxlarning ko'tarilishi muqarrar."],["The manager asked us to ___ our ideas clearly.","clarify",["undermine","exceed","deprive"],"clarify","Menejer bizdan g'oyalarimizni aniq tushuntirishni so'radi."],["Clear signs ___ that the economy is improving.","indicate",["hinder","deprive","simulate"],"indicate","Aniq belgilar iqtisodiyot yaxshilanayotganini ko'rsatadi."],["We need to ___ more money for the new project.","allocate",["endure","deviate","contradict"],"allocate","Yangi loyiha uchun ko'proq pul ajratishimiz kerak."],["She tried to ___ her mistake, but nobody believed her.","justify",["enhance","facilitate","foster"],"justify","U xatosini oqlashga urindi, lekin hech kim ishonmadi."],["Good lighting can ___ the look of a room.","enhance",["undermine","hinder","breach"],"enhance","Yaxshi yoritish xonaning ko'rinishini yaxshilashi mumkin."],["Heavy traffic can ___ the progress of the project.","hinder",["enhance","inspire","refine"],"hinder","Qattiq tirbandlik loyiha ilgarilashiga to'sqinlik qilishi mumkin."],["They will ___ the new rules next month.","implement",["hesitate","dominate","simulate"],"implement","Ular yangi qoidalarni kelasi oy joriy qiladi."],["This watch looks ___, but it is a cheap copy.","authentic",["flexible","versatile","rigid"],"authentic","Bu soat asl ko'rinadi, lekin arzon nusxa."],["He gave an ___ answer, so nobody knew what he really meant.","ambiguous",["efficient","obvious","adequate"],"ambiguous","U noaniq javob berdi, shuning uchun hech kim nima demoqchi ekanini bilmadi."],["Our new car is very ___: it uses little fuel.","efficient",["ambiguous","controversial","subtle"],"efficient","Bizning yangi mashinamiz juda tejamkor: u kam yoqilg'i sarflaydi."],["Her salary is ___ for a family of five; they can live comfortably.","adequate",["ambiguous","subtle","controversial"],"adequate","Uning maoshi besh kishilik oila uchun yetarli; ular qulay yashay oladi."],["The company wants to ___ its products in 30 countries.","distribute",["discard","distort","discourage"],"distribute","Kompaniya mahsulotlarini 30 ta mamlakatda tarqatmoqchi."],["Don't ___ the instructions! Read them carefully.","neglect",["appreciate","assist","acquire"],"neglect","Ko'rsatmalarni e'tiborsiz qoldirmang! Ularni diqqat bilan o'qing."],["After the scandal, he decided to ___ his career in politics.","abandon",["assist","acquire","appreciate"],"abandon","Mojarodan keyin u siyosatdagi faoliyatini tashlab ketishga qaror qildi."],["Their friendship ended after a long ___.","conflict",["formula","function","outcome"],"conflict","Ularning do'stligi uzoq nizodan keyin tugadi."],["There was a ___ fall in sales: it dropped by 50% in one month.","drastic",["gradual","mutual","vital"],"drastic","Savdo keskin tushdi: bir oyda 50% ga kamaydi."],["We need an ___ explanation because the first one was wrong.","accurate",["ambiguous","obsolete","arbitrary"],"accurate","Bizga aniq tushuntirish kerak, chunki birinchisi noto'g'ri edi."],["All companies must ___ with the new safety rules.","comply",["accuse","abolish","cease"],"comply","Barcha kompaniyalar yangi xavfsizlik qoidalariga rioya qilishi shart."],["Poor sleep has a negative ___ on your health.","impact",["formula","flaw","obstacle"],"impact","Yomon uyqu salomatligingizga salbiy ta'sir qiladi."]],"C1":[["The new tax rules are very ___, and many small shops cannot follow them.", "stringent", ["benign", "meager", "wary"], "stringent", "Yangi soliq qoidalari juda qat'iy, ko'p kichik do'konlar ularga amal qila olmaydi."],
["He was ___ about the offer; he asked many questions before he agreed.", "wary", ["resolute", "lucrative", "tedious"], "wary", "U taklifdan ehtiyotkor edi; rozi bo'lishdan oldin ko'p savol berdi."],
["Despite the ___ results, the team refused to give up.", "meager", ["paramount", "benign", "lucrative"], "meager", "Kam natijalarga qaramay, jamoa taslim bo'lishni istamadi."],
