["Could you repeat that, please?","Takrorlab bera olasizmi, iltimos?"],["Speak more slowly, please.","Sekinroq gapiring, iltimos."],["What time is it?","Soat necha bo'ldi?"],["I am sorry, I am late.","Kechirasiz, kech qoldim."],
["See you tomorrow.","Ertaga ko'rishamiz."],["Have a nice day!","Kuningiz xayrli o'tsin!"],
